 h Ave\, Portland\, OR 97202\nPhone: (503) 222-5756\nWebsite: https://www.p
 ortlandalano.org/plates-for-the-people\nDetails: Free cooking classes for 
 people in or seeking recovery. Led by award-winning chefs who share their 
 own recovery stories. Learn budgeting\, meal planning\, and cooking. Each 
 class ends with a shared meal. Partnership between Alano Club and Ben's Fr
 iends.
