SUMMARY:Food Court 5000 (Mall Walking Group): Final Lloyd Center Walk (Sile
 nt Disco)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Fitness & Wellness\nCost: FREE\nInfo: One last walk o
 n the mall's closing day\, with Heartbeat Silent Discos and Snap! Dance Pa
 rty (~150 headphone sets\, $10 reservation). Starts 11am in the food court
 . Part of the Aug 8 farewell day (Lloyderpalooza\, Pedalpalooza funeral ri
 de\, Lloyd Fest 4-7pm).\nAddress: Pop-up locations around Portland (check 
 foodcourt5k.com)\; permanent home not yet announced\nWebsite: https://food
 court5k.com/\nDetails: 1980s/90s-themed walking group. Dress code: neon le
 ggings\, acid-washed denim encouraged. Groups of 70+ regular attendees. Ll
 oyd Center closed permanently on August 8\, 2026\; the last regular Sunday
  walk inside the mall was August 2 and the farewell walk was Saturday Augu
 st 8. The group now walks at rotating pop-up locations around Portland (so
 me outdoors\, some indoors) and has said a permanent home is in the works\
 , but none was announced as of September 10\, 2026.
LOCATION:Pop-up locations around Portland (check foodcourt5k.com)\; permane
 nt home not yet announced
URL:https://foodcourt5k.com/
CATEGORIES:Fitness & Wellness
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
