SUMMARY:OMSI (Oregon Museum of Science and Industry): $5 Day
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: $5\nInfo: $5 admission for ever
 yone\, and $5 tickets for the Empirical Theater\, Kendall Planetarium show
 s\, USS Blueback submarine tours (ages 3+)\, and select special exhibition
