  tickets\, with no additional discounts on Value Nights. Income-assistance
  tickets are $13 each\, up to four per household\, with an Oregon Trail ca
 rd\, Washington Quest card\, OHP/Apple Health\, WIC eWIC card\, or TANF. R
 eserve them through the ZooLights income-assistance link on oregonzoo.org/
 discounts and bring proof of benefits and residency. A ZooLights ticket is
  also a TriMet and Streetcar fare to and from the zoo on your admission da
 te.\nAddress: Oregon Zoo\, 4001 SW Canyon Rd\, Portland\, OR 97221\nPhone:
  503-226-1561\nWebsite: https://www.oregonzoo.org/lights\nDetails: Annual 
 holiday light display at the Oregon Zoo\, November 20\, 2026 through Janua
 ry 3\, 2027 (closed November 24-26 and December 25). Not free\; the lowest
  ticket price is $13 (income-assistance tickets\, up to four per household
 ).
LOCATION:Oregon Zoo\, 4001 SW Canyon Rd\, Portland\, OR 97221
URL:https://www.oregonzoo.org/lights
